title: "June 2026 Heatwave over a Germany-Centred Domain: ERA5-Land Temperature and Soil-Moisture Diagnostics"

type: software

authors:
  - family-names: "Karadan"
    given-names: "Muhammed Muhshif"

version: "1.0.0"
date-released: 2026-09-10

doi: "10.5281/zenodo.22693412"

repository-code: "https://github.com/muhshif/june-2026-heatwave-germany"

abstract: >-
  A compact and reproducible Python workflow for analysing near-surface
  temperature and soil-moisture conditions during the June 2026 European
  heatwave using ERA5-Land reanalysis data over a Germany-centred domain.

